      "statement": "A logical run per schedule is created by beginDueRun (active/retrying -> pending/admission with a fresh runId and leaseExpiresAt), advanced by admitRun to pending/delivery consuming one attempt, and settled by rejectRun (admission rejected: one-shot expires, recurrence returns to active without consuming an attempt), failRun (delivery failure: retry with exponential backoff or dead after MAX_ATTEMPTS), or completeRun.",
